# Software industry mapping for CVM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/cvm/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_led_segment owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductLedSegment .
legacy:product_led_segment_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productLedSegmentId .
legacy:seat_expansion_offer owl:equivalentClass sw:SeatExpansionOffer .
legacy:seat_expansion_offer_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:seatExpansionOfferId .
legacy:targets_product_led_segment rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:targetsProductLedSegment .
